{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-awesome-all-timeline-js","path":"/2016/09/05/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Track Awesome List"}},"allAwesomeItem":{"nodes":[{"awesomeListRepo":"dylanrees/citizen-science","categoryHTML":"<h2>Educational</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://openwetware.org/wiki/Main_Page\">OpenWetWare</a> - A site that maintains a list of bio lab protocols as well as an electronic lab notebook for team use.</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T21:07:58.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ciconia/awesome-music","categoryHTML":"<h2>Music Notation</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://www.i-score.org\">i-score</a> - a software for interactive music notation, with DAW features.</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T10:43:17.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"stevemao/awesome-git-addons","categoryHTML":"<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/felixSchl/git-fiddle\">git-fiddle</a></h2>","itemHTML":"<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/felixSchl/git-fiddle\">git-fiddle</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/felixSchl/git-fiddle\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">206</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":206,\"repo\":\"felixSchl/git-fiddle\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--></h2>\n<pre><code>$ git fiddle -h\ngit-fiddle\n\nEdit commit meta information during an *interactive* rebase.\n\n`git-fiddle(1)' is a lightweight wrapper around `git-rebase(1)' that\nannotates each commit with it's *author* date, the author name, as well\nas the commit message. Changes to any of these will then be applied\nusing an 'exec' script during the git-rebase sequence.\n\nUsage:\n  $SCRIPT [--[no-]-fiddle-messages] [args...]\n\nOptions:\n  --[no-]fiddle-messages Do not edit commit messages. Useful for quick edits\n                         to author or date. This value can also be set using\n                         `git config fiddle.messages`.\n  [args...]              These arguments are passed verbatim to git-rebase.\n</code></pre>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T08:57:12.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"briatte/awesome-network-analysis","categoryHTML":"<h2>Software</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://vis.stanford.edu/jheer/projects/vizster/\">Vizster</a> - Cross-platform Java program to visualize online social networks.</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T07:41:37.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"briatte/awesome-network-analysis","categoryHTML":"<h2>Varia</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://schochastics.net/sna/periodic.html\">Periodic Table of Network Centrality</a> - Interactive periodic table of centrality indices.</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T07:38:04.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"briatte/awesome-network-analysis","categoryHTML":"<h2>Software</h2><h3>JavaScript</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://www.tobiasstark.nl/GENSI/GENSI.htm\">GENSI</a> - JavaScript graphical tool to collect ego-centered network data (<a href=\"http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0378873316300284\">paper</a>).</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T07:28:33.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"h4cc/awesome-elixir","categoryHTML":"<h2>Deployment</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/hashrocket/gatling\">gatling</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/hashrocket/gatling\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">502</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":502,\"repo\":\"hashrocket/gatling\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - Collection of mix tasks to automatically create a exrm release from git and launch/upgrade it on your server.</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T07:27:38.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"fffaraz/awesome-cpp","categoryHTML":"<h2>Image Processing</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://cimg.eu/\">CImg</a> - A small, open source, C++ toolkit for image processing. [Own LGPL or GPL]</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T07:18:12.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"J2TEAM/awesome-AutoIt","categoryHTML":"<h2>Useful Resources</h2><h3>Videos</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_-NI9iPtoB741rTw1hjNPirk3jTMKtrQ\">Advanced AutoIt Tutorials</a> by Juno_okyo [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEETpUrNm5qI-LENbBON2Gw/?sub_confirmation=1\">Subscribe</a>].</li>","updatedAt":"2016-09-05T01:34:57.000Z"}]}},"pageContext":{"type":"day","from":1473033600000,"to":1473119999999,"previousId":"2016-09-06","nextId":"2016-09-04","nextName":"Sep 4th, 2016","previousName":"Sep 6th, 2016"}},"staticQueryHashes":["228695001","2744905544","2828988102"]}